  "notes": "Boot a Family Guy S.A.M. ROM from an empty NVRAM and enter the Single Coil Test with the named service keys (Back, Select x3 reach the diagnostics menu with SW highlighted, Plus moves to COIL, Select opens the coil menu, Select starts Single Coil Test). Select energizes the coil on display; each Plus advances the ROM's own selector. 35 selector positions are visited and each is fired once, so every coil name and transistor shown on the display is paired with the public solenoid addresses that changed while it was fired. The scenario names no game."
